  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote Peace Building and Stability in the Blue Nile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to the overarching objective of the peace building and stability in Blue Nile state with specific objective to ensure that the targeted population of IDPs and vulnerable families and groups in Ad-Damazine Locality are able to meet their essential needs in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
